# Prettier does not read .gitignore, so anything ignored there that Prettier
# would otherwise walk has to be repeated here. Without this file
# `npx prettier --check .` reports ~32 violations in figma-draft alone and the
# two real ones are lost in the noise.

# Build and tool output
/dist
/tmp
/out-tsc
/.angular
/coverage

# The Figma export the design tokens were derived from. Gitignored and not in
# the repo, so it is nobody's code to format — but it sits inside frontend/ on
# a machine that has it, which is enough for Prettier to walk it.
/figma-draft

# Generated, and not ours to lay out.
package-lock.json
